---
// The seven spans of one slow trace, values copied from the p10_spans table
// (start offset "at ms" and duration "ms"). The evidence-lab span is red.
// Bars under 1 px are drawn 2 px wide so they stay visible; their ms labels
// carry the true value.
const W = 900, H = 330;
const x0 = 360, pxPerMs = 470 / 1227.08;
const spans = [
  { d: 0, at: 0, ms: 1227.08, en: 'clue-api  GET /cases/{case_id}/report', vi: 'clue-api  GET /cases/{case_id}/report' },
  { d: 1, at: 1.14, ms: 0.07, en: 'connect', vi: 'connect' },
  { d: 1, at: 1.56, ms: 0.08, en: 'SELECT', vi: 'SELECT' },
  { d: 1, at: 2.08, ms: 1.45, en: 'CaseService.get_case', vi: 'CaseService.get_case' },
  { d: 2, at: 2.5, ms: 0.07, en: 'SELECT', vi: 'SELECT' },
  { d: 1, at: 4.22, ms: 1220.35, en: 'GET (httpx call)', vi: 'GET (httpx gọi đi)' },
  { d: 2, at: 5.8, ms: 1218.59, en: 'evidence-lab  GET /analyze/{case_id}', vi: 'evidence-lab  GET /analyze/{case_id}', red: true },
];
---
<figure class="bep10d">
  <div class="bep10d-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A waterfall of seven spans in one trace. The top span, the whole request, lasts 1227.08 milliseconds. Its database spans and service span last under 1.5 milliseconds each. The outgoing httpx call lasts 1220.35 milliseconds and contains the evidence-lab span of 1218.59 milliseconds, drawn in red.">
    <text x="40" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>one slow request, drawn as a trace</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một request chậm, vẽ thành trace</tspan></text>
    <line x1={x0} y1="44" x2={x0} y2="304" class="axis" />
    {spans.map((s, i) => (
      <g>
        <text x={40 + s.d * 16} y={72 + i * 36} class={s.red ? 'nm red' : 'nm'}><tspan data-lang-en>{s.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{s.vi}</tspan></text>
        <rect x={x0 + s.at * pxPerMs} y={58 + i * 36} width={Math.max(2, s.ms * pxPerMs)} height="16" class={s.red ? 'bar red' : 'bar'} />
        <text x={x0 + s.at * pxPerMs + Math.max(2, s.ms * pxPerMs) + 8} y={72 + i * 36} class={s.red ? 'ms red' : 'ms'}><tspan data-lang-en>{s.ms} ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{s.ms} ms</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Values are the "at ms" and "ms" columns of the table above. Everything except the call to the second service is too thin to see: the time went into evidence-lab.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giá trị lấy từ cột "at ms" và "ms" của bảng phía trên. Mọi thứ trừ lời gọi sang service thứ hai đều mỏng đến mức không thấy: thời gian nằm ở evidence-lab.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep10d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep10d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep10d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep10d text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep10d .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep10d .nm.red, .bep10d .ms.red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep10d .ms { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep10d .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep10d .bar.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep10d .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep10d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
